{"id": "unknown-2026-06-09-013", "date": "2026-06-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["food_safety", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Boar's Head inspection documents show years of safety problems preceded outbreak", "content": "<p>More inspection documents showing food safety violations at the Boar&#x2019;s Head production facility in Jarrett, VA, have come to light. A deadly outbreak of Listeria infections in 2024 was traced to products from the plant.</p><p>The outbreak, which ran from January to July in 2024, sickened 61 people</p>", "sources": [{"name": "food_safety_news", "url": "https://www.foodsafetynews.com/2026/06/boars-head-inspection-documents-show-years-of-safety-problems-preceded-outbreak/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-09-014", "date": "2026-06-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["food_safety"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Pancake/waffle mix recalled because of undeclared allergens", "content": "<p>Ballester Hermanos is recalling pouches of Pearl Milling Company original pancake and waffle complete mix because of undeclared milk and soy. People who have an allergy or severe sensitivity to milk and/or soy run the risk of a serious or life-threatening allergic reaction if they consume the recalled product.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "food_safety_news", "url": "https://www.foodsafetynews.com/2026/06/pancake-waffle-mix-recalled-because-of-undeclared-allergens/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-09-015", "date": "2026-06-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["food_safety", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Requeson cheese recalled because of Listeria risk", "content": "<p>Nelson &amp; Isa Lacteos LLC of Bayshore, NY, is recalling its of Requeson Cheese because it may be contaminated with Listeria monocytogenes.</p><p>The recalled Requeson Cheese was sold in 1-pound plastic clam shells in retail locations in New York from May 15 to May 28, 2026. Product was likely repacked</p>", "sources": [{"name": "food_safety_news", "url": "https://www.foodsafetynews.com/2026/06/requeson-cheese-recalled-because-of-listeria-risk/", "type": "rss"}]}
